e of the human cytokines BAFF and IL6, we observed increases in retention of plasma cells in the bone marrow, with engraftment exceeding a year. The most profound in vivo effects of human IL6 were observed within 20 days of transfer and could be explained by decreased apoptosis in newly differentiated plasma cells. Collectively, these results show that ex vivo engineered and differentiated human plasma cells have the potential for long-lived in vivo protein secretion, which can be modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":79235},{"name":"carothersresearch/CRISPRai_Circuits_2022","owner":"carothersresearch","html_url":"https://github.com/carothersresearch/CRISPRai_Circuits_2022","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Repository to share materials for: Alba Burbano and Cardiff et al, 2022,","topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":79301},{"name":"kaniagalih/Stunting-Prediction-Model","owner":"kaniagalih","html_url":"https://github.com/kaniagalih/Stunting-Prediction-Model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Stunting Prediction using Random Forest and Logistic Regression with accuracy  85%","topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":79317},{"name":"gustavofernandezlembert/Placemarks.KML_TO_HTML","owner":"gustavofernandezlembert","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavofernandezlembert/Placemarks.KML_TO_HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":79338},{"name":"kthyng/janelle2019","owner":"kthyng","html_url":"https://github.com/kthyng/janelle2019","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2350,"global_rank":79349},{"name":"Viktor-Butkovich/AIvengers","owner":"Viktor-Butkovich","html_url":"https://github.com/Viktor-Butkovich/AIvengers","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"